      "end_line": 1,
      "raw": "# Native navigation model gallery\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Native navigation model gallery"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 5,
      "raw": "This C++23 example compiles LVUI through AOT and connects native route matching,\nresolution and presentation history to iiGUI labels and buttons. The application\nentry, background work, frame loop and shutdown belong to iiSDKCore.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 6,
      "end_line": 6,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 7,
      "end_line": 9,
      "raw": "Application sources live in `App/`. This is a navigation-model integration\nexample, not a completed routed-page host. Per-page creation, scope retirement,\npage transitions and the full PageRouter/Navigator/Link surface remain pending.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000006",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 10,
      "end_line": 10,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 11,
      "end_line": 14,
      "raw": "Build with the installed LVRS native CMake package and its native dependencies.\nUse a `build/` output directory. `--self-test` is registered for the final\nverification batch; it must not be launched during the current implementation\nphase, in accordance with the user's execution policy.\n"
    }
  ],
